# Add the remaining authors, the affiliations of the co-authors, and, once the
# release is archived, the fields doi, repository-code and version.
abstract: >-
  Data and code for an eight-benchmark assessment of forest cover and landscape
  configuration in a 0 to 100 m band around fourteen reservoirs in Rio de
  Janeiro State, Brazil, compared with a 100 to 500 m control band of the same
  reservoirs. Four pre-reform benchmarks test, rather than assume, the
  parallel-trends assumption.
